    "AI 整理收藏时会自动打标签,也可以在上面手动创建。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI tags items automatically when organizing them; you can also create tags manually above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 整理收藏时会自动打标签,也可以在上面手动创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 整理新收藏时会优先复用这里的标签。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI prefers reusing these tags when organizing new items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 整理新收藏时会优先复用这里的标签。"
