    "agent.md 是总则,待办/记忆是可分别编辑的技能;编辑会直接改变发给 AI 的指令,重置可恢复默认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent.md is the general rules; todo/memory are separately editable skills. Edits directly change the instructions sent to the AI; reset restores the defaults."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent.md 是总则,待办/记忆是可分别编辑的技能;编辑会直接改变发给 AI 的指令,重置可恢复默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
