    "任务名(如:今日穿搭)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Task name (e.g. Today's outfit)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务名(如:今日穿搭)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会自动打上「人脉」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「人脉」才会看到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is tagged \"Contact\" automatically; hidden from the memory list by default, shown only when you filter for \"Contact\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会自动打上「人脉」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「人脉」才会看到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会自动打上「资产」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「资产」才会看到,并在顶部汇总总额。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is tagged \"Asset\" automatically; hidden from the memory list by default, shown only when you filter for \"Asset\", and summed at the top."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会自动打上「资产」标签,记忆列表默认不显示,筛选里选中「资产」才会看到,并在顶部汇总总额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在对话里说过的长期要求(如「以后开会都留一小时」)会被 AI 自动记在这里,之后每轮对话都会带上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standing preferences you've mentioned in chat (like \"always leave an hour for meetings\") are recorded here automatically and included in every future conversation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在对话里说过的长期要求(如「以后开会都留一小时」)会被 AI 自动记在这里,之后每轮对话都会带上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用内置 API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Built-in API Key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用内置 API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如:改到明天晚上8点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. move to tomorrow 8pm"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如:改到明天晚上8点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "像一位干练的行政秘书:简洁、专业、直接,不说废话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like a sharp executive assistant: concise, professional, and direct—no fluff."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像一位干练的行政秘书:简洁、专业、直接,不说废话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "像自律教练:直接有推动力,催促按时完成,语气可以严厉但保持尊重。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like a disciplined coach: direct and motivating, pushes you to finish on time, can be firm but stays respectful."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像自律教练:直接有推动力,催促按时完成,语气可以严厉但保持尊重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许联网搜索": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Web Search"
